PICS 0
BACnet Protocol Implementation Conformance Statement
Vendor Name: "Chipkin Automation Systems"
Product Name: "CAS BACnet Stack Example - B-ACC"
Product Model Number: "CAS BACnet Stack Example - B-ACC"
Product Description: "A BACnet/IP Access Control Controller built on the CAS BACnet Stack. It presents the access family (Access Door, Credential Data Input, Access Point, Access Zone, Access Credential, Access Rights), an Event Log, a Schedule/Calendar pair, a File object for backup/restore, a Notification Class, three read-only sensor objects and the required Network Port. Blocked Example: it makes no grant/deny decision and generates no access event (CAS BACnet Stack #2150, #2044). It is a tutorial for implementers of the B-ACC profile."

BACnet Standardized Device Profiles Supported:
{
B-ACC - BACnet Access Control Controller
}

BIBBs Supported:
{
DS-RP-B
DS-RPM-B
DS-WP-B
DS-WPM-B
DS-COV-B
AE-ACK-B
AE-INFO-B
SCHED-I-B
DM-BR-B
DM-DDB-A
DM-DDB-B
DM-DOB-B
DM-DCC-B
DM-TS-B
DM-UTC-B
DM-RD-B
}

BACnet Standard Application Services Supported:
{
AcknowledgeAlarm Execute
ConfirmedCOVNotification Initiate
ConfirmedEventNotification Initiate
SubscribeCOV Execute
AtomicReadFile Execute
AtomicWriteFile Execute
ReadProperty Execute
ReadPropertyMultiple Execute
WriteProperty Execute
WritePropertyMultiple Execute
DeviceCommunicationControl Execute
ReinitializeDevice Execute
IAm Initiate Execute
IHave Initiate
